ds/origins/706788d6-63cc-44ca-8b7c-924fd344a68e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=13d4e6cbc866465bc00ca2c0996d3f3a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b711ec1/uploads/origins/706788d6-63cc-44ca-8b7c-924fd344a68e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=13d4e6cbc866465bc00ca2c0996d3f3a, https://si.imgix.net/3b711ec1/uploads/origins/706788d6-63cc-44ca-8b7c-924fd344a68e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9ea7f7147fd85b61a9ba929a4ad38c21 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3b711ec1/uploads/origins/706788d6-63cc-44ca-8b7c-924fd344a68e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=82e21a1c03e6710e3988b0547da3ad78 3x"}, "body": "Hello Shiba!\nI am absolutely enchanted by your art and I am looking for something special for a DnD event. It is quite an extensive request, but I truly hope you might enjoy bringing it to life.\n\nI would love to commission 6 separate character illustrations. Extra Outfits and references are attached.\n\t•\tJeevy (Warlock): A moonshadow elf with horns, long violet hair, and a flowing black robe with glowing tattoos.\n\t•\tTshii (Bard): Plays a harp, has black and green hair tied into a braid, and cat ears.\n\t•\tNyan (Tabaxi Warrior): An orange, black, and white spotted Tabaxi who walks upright. She wears her crown along with a typical warrior’s armor.\n\t•\tKarihina (Mage): Has long twisted pink braids and long fox ears.\n\t•\tYusaki (Druid/Fae): A small fairy, only reaching about hip height compared to the others. She has a horn on her forehead and short pink hair.\n\t•\tBlieb (Dungeon Master): A dragon kobold player character. He is rather weak, with firm dolphin-like skin and horned ears.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1s5dQY_IBqlU-KwRFFmgzinRHxFT97G-O", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibaza