hort bob that is slightly curled inward, side and back hair trimmed at about the mouth line, and a softly cropped collar (depending on the composition, it may or may not be visible).\nSailor uniform with short sleeves\nShort-sleeved sailor uniform\nSituation\nThe right arm is in a cast and is hanging from the neck with a triangular bandage.\n　-Please place the knot of the triangular bandage at the neck and elbow in a visible position (please refer to the URL of the document).\n　　(This is a minor detail, but there is a difference: the neck has one knot and two ends of the triangular bandage, while the elbow has one knot and one end of the triangular bandage.)\n　-Please make sure that the right arm is in the frame.\nOne adhesive bandage on the cheek.\n-An expression of embarrassment, not darkened by the injury, as shown below.\n　Wink with one eye, tongue sticking out, so-called \"tehepero\" expression.\n\nMy personal point is to moe the bandage and still look cute and energetic.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iLDkTBdxs4w", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibazakie_/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 276572, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd9a1c3a/uploads/origins/dbf9e7fe-5642-49a5-b229-304846b94968?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7be7aca144de598d6382a8c0dad1faf0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd9a1c3a/uploads/origins/dbf9e7fe-5642-49a5-b229-304846b94968?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7be7aca144de598d6382a8c0dad1faf0, https://si.imgix.net/cd9a1c3a/uploads/origins/dbf9e7fe-5642-49a5-b229-304846b94968?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02a8de9c57f8775a9d887e6a9e0c3ae9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd9a1c3a/uploads/origins/dbf9e7fe-5642-49a5-b229-304846b9496