ivate, she’s actually a clumsy otaku. After work, she enjoys curling up in bed to play games. Occasionally, she makes “dark cuisine” cakes and cookies and forces them on everyone. ( ̀⌄ ́)\n\nPlease feel free to use your creativity for the design! You can change her outfit, but if possible, keep some key features.\n\nThe intended uses are for Vtuber streaming events and display on social media.\n\nIf it’s possible to provide PSD data with separate layers for the character and background, that would be greatly appreciated!\n\nSorry for the long message orz\nThank you for considering my request!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KBLvBo_Cu87yEHwXxW-F34mZbhbwwyQ9", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibazakie_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 276572, "client_id": 3173637, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f930e61da2a4301ca9408eecbfe09d5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f930e61da2a4301ca9408eecbfe09d5, https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=721f05862536276f17a74ae0465efbb5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0613792636ceaa1c23b22315161402d1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=